            "review_title": "Review at Terminal 46 Mixology Bar",
            "review_text": "John F\nLondon, United Kingdom19 contributions\n0\nGreat vibe, delicious cocktails!!\nJan 2020 • Couples\nWe came here on a Saturday night and had two cocktails each. The bar has travel-themed vibe, with great attention to detail. The staff were all very friendly, and the barmen were very skilled. Would recommend!\nWritten January 18, 2020\nThaoDinh\nSo great to know you have been spent a good time with our vibe and bartenders. They are looking to get more of your challenges to give them in the next time. Cheers 🍸🥂\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
