            "review_title": "Review at Terminal 46 Mixology Bar",
            "review_text": "ndcoach\nLos Angeles, California213 contributions\n1\nWhat a great place the two\nJan 2020\nWhat a great place the two bartenders are outstanding everybody here is so friendly and helpful if you want a good cocktail at a speakeasy in Saigon you must stop by terminal 46. I had to Moscow Mule and they actually have a ginger beer and a dirty martini with plenty of olives\nWritten January 17, 2020\nThaoDinh\nThanks for your precious comment. It is really delightful for anyone is looking for a place doing good cocktails and would love to try any classic cocktail made by the local bartenders\nWe also have our signature cocktails must try. Come back and bring your friends to enjoy the atmosphere at Terminal46 Mixology Bar. You are always welcome\nHave a good weekend. Cheers\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
