            "review_title": "Review at Terminal 46 Mixology Bar",
            "review_text": "Len Dodson\nLos Angeles, California2 contributions\n1\nInspiring cocktails and great vibes\nDec 2019 • Friends\nHad an awesome time at T46. The signature drinks are all unique and fresh and the mixologist tries to push the envelope and explore new tastes! The classic cocktails are spot on as well if you’re looking for a familiar drink. The staff are friendly, four of them made it a point to come over and welcome us! They change the music weekly on Saturday nights to keep it fresh :)\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2019",
