            "review_title": "Review at Terminal 46 Mixology Bar",
            "review_text": "HniVinH\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nNice\nNov 2019 • Solo\nOne of the best bars in Saigon, 100% would come back if I was in town. They got a great selection of spirits and infused homemade liquors. The atmosphere is great and the staff makes you feel welcomed. On top of everything, the bartender with the man bun is extremely dashing, one of the most gorgeous man I've ever seen since birth. I love you man.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2019",
